WEBVTT

00:00:15.992 --> 00:00:17.232
Edmund?
爱德蒙？

00:00:17.792 --> 00:00:21.192
I would very much like to meet
the rest of your family.
我很想见见你的家人

00:00:21.392 --> 00:00:22.472
Why?
为什么？

00:00:23.632 --> 00:00:25.632
They're nothing special.
他们没什么特别的地方

00:00:26.352 --> 00:00:31.312
Oh, I'm sure they're not nearly
as delightful as you are.
哦 他们肯定没有你
这么讨人喜欢

00:00:33.312 --> 00:00:36.552
But you see, Edmund,
I have no children of my own.
可是 爱德蒙
我没有自己的孩子

00:00:37.632 --> 00:00:39.672
And you are exactly the sort of boy
日后我可以让你…

00:00:39.832 --> 00:00:44.312
who I could see, one day,
becoming Prince of Narnia.
…成为纳尼亚的王子

00:00:45.272 --> 00:00:46.952
Maybe even King.
甚至是国王

00:00:48.712 --> 00:00:49.992
Really?
真的吗？

00:00:51.432 --> 00:00:54.312
Of course, you'd have
to bring your family.
当然了 你得把你的家人带来

00:00:55.312 --> 00:00:58.792
Do you mean, Peter would be king too?
你是说彼得也会成为国王？

00:00:58.952 --> 00:01:01.512
No! No, no.
不…

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:04.392
But a king needs servants.
可是国王需要仆人

00:01:07.032 --> 00:01:09.112
I guess I could bring them.
我想我能把他们带来

00:01:13.472 --> 00:01:16.472
Beyond these woods,
you see those two hills?
在那些树林后面
你看到那两座山了吗？

00:01:16.632 --> 00:01:18.952
My house is right between them.
我的宫殿就在那两座山之间

00:01:19.672 --> 00:01:21.672
You'd love it there, Edmund.
你会喜欢那儿的 爱德蒙

00:01:21.832 --> 00:01:25.632
It has whole rooms
simply stuffed with Turkish delight.
那里有满屋子的土耳其软糖

00:01:26.712 --> 00:01:29.552
-Couldn't I have some more now?
-No!
我现在能再吃一点吗？
不行

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:34.832
Don't want to ruin your appetite.
我不想破坏你的胃口

00:01:34.992 --> 00:01:38.152
Besides, you and I are going to be seeing
each other again very soon, aren't we?
何况我们很快就会再次见面的

00:01:38.312 --> 00:01:40.752
I hope so, Your Majesty.
希望如此 女王陛下

00:01:42.232 --> 00:01:46.232
Until then, dear one.
I'm gonna miss you.
在那之前 亲爱的 我会想你的

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:00.832
Edmund?
爱德蒙？

00:02:02.632 --> 00:02:05.072
Oh, Edmund! You got in too!
哦 爱德蒙 你也来了

00:02:05.232 --> 00:02:06.952
Isn't it wonderful?
是不是很奇妙？

00:02:07.872 --> 00:02:11.592
-Where have you been?
-With Mr. Tumnus. He's fine.
你去哪儿了？
去找吐纳思先生了 他没事

00:02:12.392 --> 00:02:16.232
The White Witch hasn't found out
anything about him meeting me.
白女巫不知道他见过我

00:02:16.392 --> 00:02:18.072
The White Witch?
白女巫？

00:02:18.552 --> 00:02:22.392
She calls herself the Queen of Narnia,
but she really isn't.
她说自己是纳尼亚女王
但其实不是

00:02:24.032 --> 00:02:27.032
Are you all right? You look awful.
你还好吧？你的脸色很难看

00:02:27.192 --> 00:02:30.432
Well, what'd you expect?
I mean, it's freezing.
不然你还想怎样？这里这么冷

00:02:31.192 --> 00:02:34.152
-How do we get out of here?
-Come on.
我们怎么出去呢？
跟我来

00:02:35.112 --> 00:02:36.432
This way.
这边

00:02:39.232 --> 00:02:41.072
Peter, Peter, wake up! Peter, wake up!
彼得 醒醒 彼得 醒醒

00:02:41.232 --> 00:02:42.392
It's there! It's really there!
它在那儿 真的在那儿

00:02:42.552 --> 00:02:43.552
(SHUSHING)
它在那儿 真的在那儿

00:02:43.712 --> 00:02:45.832
-Lucy, what are you talking about?
-Narnia!
露西 你在说什么？
纳尼亚

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:48.152
It's all in the wardrobe like I told you!
就在衣橱里
就像我跟你说过的那样

00:02:48.312 --> 00:02:51.472
-You've just been dreaming, Lucy.
-But I haven't!
你是在做梦 露西
我没有

00:02:51.632 --> 00:02:55.592
I saw Mr. Tumnus again!
And this time Edmund went too.
我又见到吐纳思先生了
这次爱德蒙也去了

00:02:58.832 --> 00:03:01.392
You... You saw the faun?
你…你看到那个人羊了？

00:03:05.152 --> 00:03:08.232
Well, he didn't actually
go there with me.
其实他并没有跟我一起
去吐纳思先生家

00:03:10.112 --> 00:03:11.272
He...
他…

00:03:15.312 --> 00:03:17.472
What were you doing, Edmund?
你当时在干什么呢 爱德蒙？

00:03:19.672 --> 00:03:21.792
I was just playing along.
我只是在陪她演戏

00:03:22.832 --> 00:03:24.312
I'm sorry, Peter.
对不起 彼得

00:03:24.472 --> 00:03:26.792
I shouldn't have encouraged her,
我不应该鼓励她的

00:03:26.992 --> 00:03:29.952
but you know what little children
are like these days.
可你知道 现在的孩子
都是这样的

00:03:30.112 --> 00:03:33.672
They just don't know
when to stop pretending.
他们只是不知道
什么时候该停止假装

00:03:34.072 --> 00:03:35.072
(CRYING)

00:03:36.952 --> 00:03:39.032
(BOTH SIGH)

00:03:44.872 --> 00:03:45.872
(GASPS)

00:03:51.272 --> 00:03:55.112
You children are one shenanigan
shy of sleepin' in the stable!
你们这些淘气的孩子
应该让你们住在马厩里才对

00:03:56.352 --> 00:04:01.832
Professor. I'm sorry. I told them
you were not to be disturbed.
教授 对不起
我告诉过他们不要打扰你

00:04:01.992 --> 00:04:05.912
It's all right, Mrs. Macready.
I'm sure there's an explanation.
没关系 麦瑞蒂太太
我相信这其中必有原因

00:04:06.872 --> 00:04:10.312
But first of all, I think this one
is in need of a little hot chocolate.
不过 首先我认为这个小姑娘
需要喝些热巧克力

00:04:10.472 --> 00:04:12.152
Come along, dear.
来吧 亲爱的

00:04:12.792 --> 00:04:14.352
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:04:20.872 --> 00:04:25.232
You seem to have upset the delicate
internal balance of my housekeeper.
你们好像把我的管家
搞得神经衰弱

00:04:25.392 --> 00:04:28.112
We're very sorry, sir.
It won't happen again.
我们真的很抱歉 先生
以后不会再发生这种事

00:04:28.272 --> 00:04:30.792
It's our sister, sir. Lucy.
是因为我们的妹妹 露西

00:04:30.952 --> 00:04:33.752
-The weeping girl.
-Yes, sir.
那个哭泣的小姑娘
对 先生

00:04:33.912 --> 00:04:36.792
-She's upset.
-Hence the weeping.
她很难过
所以才会哭泣

00:04:36.952 --> 00:04:38.312
It's nothing.
没事的

00:04:38.472 --> 00:04:41.112
-We can handle it.
-Oh, I can see that.
我们能处理好
这我能看得出来

00:04:43.432 --> 00:04:45.912
She thinks she's found a magical land.
她自以为发现了一个魔法王国

00:04:46.112 --> 00:04:48.112
In the upstairs wardrobe.
就在楼上的衣橱里

00:04:51.072 --> 00:04:52.912
What did you say?
你说什么？

00:04:53.912 --> 00:04:55.952
The wardrobe, upstairs.
楼上的衣橱

00:04:57.072 --> 00:04:59.672
Lucy thinks she's found a forest inside.
露西以为她在里面
找到了一片森林

00:04:59.832 --> 00:05:02.312
She won't stop going on about it.
她一直在说这件事

00:05:02.752 --> 00:05:06.232
-What was it like?
-Like talking to a lunatic.
那是什么样的？
就像在跟一个疯子对话

00:05:06.392 --> 00:05:08.792
No, no, no, not her. The forest.
我不是指她 我是说那片森林

00:05:08.952 --> 00:05:12.192
-You're not saying you believe her?
-You don't?
你不会是说你相信她吧？
你们不相信她？

00:05:12.392 --> 00:05:13.872
But of course not.
当然不相信

00:05:14.032 --> 00:05:16.472
I mean, logically, it's impossible.
我是说 从逻辑上说来
这是不可能的

00:05:16.632 --> 00:05:19.432
What do they teach
in schools these days?
现在的学校都在教些什么啊？

00:05:19.592 --> 00:05:21.432
Edmund said
they were only pretending.
爱德蒙说他们是在玩假装游戏

00:05:21.592 --> 00:05:23.552
He's usually the more
truthful one, is he?
他比较诚实可靠 是吗？

00:05:23.712 --> 00:05:27.232
No. This would be the first time.
不 这可能是第一次

00:05:27.392 --> 00:05:29.152
Well, if she's not mad
and she's not lying,
如果她既没疯也没撒谎

00:05:29.312 --> 00:05:33.312
then logically we must
assume she's telling the truth.
那么从逻辑上说来
我们就得假定她说的是实话

00:05:34.792 --> 00:05:37.992
You're saying that we
should just believe her?
你是说我们应该相信她？

00:05:39.512 --> 00:05:42.992
She's your sister, isn't she?
You're her family.
她是你们的妹妹 不是吗？
你们是她的家人

00:05:45.712 --> 00:05:48.312
You might just try acting like one.
你们应该表现得像一家人

00:05:49.192 --> 00:05:53.232
Peter winds up,
poised to take yet another wicket!
彼得挥动手臂 准备再投一球

00:05:53.592 --> 00:05:54.672
Ow!

00:05:55.112 --> 00:05:56.112
Whoops!

00:05:56.312 --> 00:05:58.352
Wake up, Dolly Daydream.
醒醒吧 别做白日梦了

00:05:59.632 --> 00:06:02.072
Why can't we play
hide and seek again?
我们干嘛不再玩捉迷藏呢？

00:06:02.272 --> 00:06:04.512
I thought you said it was a kid's game.
我记得你说那是孩子玩的游戏

00:06:04.672 --> 00:06:08.472
Besides, we could all use the fresh air.
再说了
我们可以呼吸一下新鲜空气

00:06:09.032 --> 00:06:11.752
It's not like there isn't air inside.
屋里又不是没有空气

00:06:12.632 --> 00:06:14.792
-Are you ready?
-Are you?
准备好了吗？
你呢？

00:06:23.032 --> 00:06:24.272
(GASPS)

00:06:33.152 --> 00:06:35.112
-Well done, Ed.
-You bowled it!
干得好 爱德
是你扔的球

00:06:35.272 --> 00:06:36.712
MACREADY: What on earth is goin' on?
这到底是怎么回事？
是麦瑞蒂太太

00:06:36.872 --> 00:06:37.872
The Macready!
这到底是怎么回事？
是麦瑞蒂太太

00:06:38.032 --> 00:06:39.272
Come on!
快跑

00:06:47.512 --> 00:06:49.592
No, no, back, back, back!
不…回去…

00:06:56.672 --> 00:06:58.592
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)

00:07:01.592 --> 00:07:03.512
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)

